@* [EDUCATIONAL NOTE - Lab 9 S1 & Lab 8 S1]:
   MainLayout Architecture:
   1. Inherits LayoutComponentBase to provide the structural shell across all routed pages.
   2. Persistent AudioPlayerBar: Placing <AudioPlayerBar /> in MainLayout guarantees that
      HTTP 206 byte-range audio streaming continues uninterrupted when the student navigates
      between pages (Home -> ManageTracks -> Playlists -> UAT Checklist).
   3. Reactive State: All child components interact via shared Scoped services (PlayerStateService,
      ClientCacheService, and AuthStateService). *@

@inherits LayoutComponentBase

<div class="app-container">
    <!-- Sidebar Navigation -->
    <NavMenu />

    <!-- Main Routed Body -->
    <main class="app-main">
        @Body
    </main>

    <!-- Persistent Bottom Audio Player Bar -->
    <AudioPlayerBar />
</div>
